SurfelMeshing (github.com/puzzlepaint/surfelmeshing @bdee93e) for update_layer/backends/surfelmeshing.
  CUDA 12.8 / sm_120 build fixes, Qt5X11Extras optional, --headless (no OpenGL context: WSL2),
  and the update-layer coupling (--command_mode, --no_conflict_update, --no_meshing, deleted
  surfels out of the min-depth and association passes, surfel buffer check).
Build (FT/baselines/surfelmeshing, git apply this file):
  cmake -S . -B build_cuda128 -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo \
    -DCMAKE_CUDA_COMPILER=FT/envs/cuda128/bin/nvcc \
    -DCMAKE_CUDA_FLAGS="-arch=sm_120 -I FT/baselines/surfelmeshing_deps/curand-10.3.9.90/include" \
    -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-I FT/baselines/surfelmeshing_deps/curand-10.3.9.90/include"
  make -C build_cuda128 SurfelMeshing

